{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Big Days 是一款專注管理重要日期的簡約 App，適合需要追蹤生日、紀念日、發薪日、考試、旅程或專案里程碑的讀者。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-63.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>倒數與備忘一目瞭然</h2>\n<p>Big Days 以 SwiftUI 打造流暢穩定的原生體驗，介面簡潔清晰。它支援未來事件倒數與過去事件正數，今日事件會特別標示；你可編輯、置頂、加入備註或刪除活動，並為每個活動記錄多則回憶。主畫面小工具可直接查看進度，本地提醒提供彈性偏好與重複規則，另支援中英文、外觀主題及 iCloud 同步。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-489-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-490-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-491-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-492-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Big Days: Date Countdown</li><li>應用類別：Lifestyle</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/big-days-date-countdown/id6759002825?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T11:54:49.973623+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":302,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T03:26:58+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T12:18:46.543382+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T11:51:43.080729+00:00","content_hash":"ea6b408fc3aed64eed6264a346a87aadb1c9df1b74134b1999cf837f63dfa7c3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}